id: DRAFT-vfit-2.1.0-legacy-poetry-copytree-wrapper
trigger_tool: conan|pip|python
phase: packaging
error_signature: BackendUnavailable.*poetry\.masonry\.api|Cannot import 'poetry\.masonry\.api'|pip\._vendor\.pyproject_hooks\._impl\.BackendUnavailable
severity: 3
category: build-system, python, packaging, ohos
match_keywords: hmbs_repair_method, backendunavailable, poetry.masonry.api, pure_python_copytree, noarch_wrapper
title: legacy poetry后端缺失时纯Python包免构建直拷打包与wrapper注入PYTHONPATH
root_cause: vfit 2.1.0 的 pyproject.toml 声明 legacy 构建后端 poetry.masonry.api，真机仅提供现代 pip 未安装 poetry，即使附加 --no-build-isolation 仍需导入该后端，pip._vendor.pyproject_hooks 抛出 BackendUnavailable 导致 package() 直接失败
verification_cmd: 真机 conan create 日志不再出现 BackendUnavailable/poetry.masonry.api；检查 package_folder/lib/pythonX.Y/site-packages/vfit 已通过 shutil.copytree 拷贝且 bin/vfit wrapper 运行时将 ../lib/pythonX.Y/site-packages 插入 sys.path 后 from vfit.app import main 调用成功
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: pure-python-copytree-with-wrapper
rec_description: 放弃依赖 poetry.masonry.api 的 pip 构建安装，改为纯Python源码直拷至 site-packages 并自生成 bin/vfit wrapper 动态注入 PYTHONPATH；build() 中运行时依赖安装改为 best-effort 警告模式，保持幂等与重入，可跨同类 legacy poetry 纯Python库复用
affected_scope: pyproject.toml 使用 poetry.masonry.api 且源码为纯Python无编译扩展、原配方在 package() 中使用 pip install --prefix 方式打包的库
rec_command: archives/v/vfit/2.1.0/conanfile.py package(): 删除 self.run pip install --prefix，改为 shutil.copytree(os.path.join(self.source_folder,"vfit"), os.path.join(self.package_folder,"lib/pythonX.Y/site-packages/vfit"))；自生成 os.path.join(self.package_folder,"bin/vfit") 写入 #!/usr/bin/env python3 + sys.path.insert + from vfit.app import main；build(): pip install fonttools/tqdm/brotli 用 try/except 包裹失败仅 self.output.warning
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: install-poetry-backend-then-pip
fallback_description: 若目标包非纯Python需编译扩展或复杂 entry_points 直拷不可用，则在构建环境先 pip install poetry 提供 poetry.masonry.api 后端，再回退到 pip install --prefix 流程
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: pip install.*--prefix|poetry\.masonry\.api
forbid_1_reason: 禁止在未提供 poetry.masonry.api 的环境中继续以 pip install --prefix 触发 legacy poetry 构建，必然复现 BackendUnavailable
forbid_1_consequence: package() 阶段抛出 BackendUnavailable: Cannot import 'poetry.masonry.api'，conan create 退出码1，HMBS 真机门禁不通过
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-vfit-2.1.0-legacy-poetry-copytree-wrapper.md
last_updated: 2026-09-19
source_event: vfit/2.1.0 真机 package() BackendUnavailable 修复并通过全部门禁
 TResult: [hmbs_repair_method]
authors: hmbs-executor
